INDEX 37
GHSA GHSA-c32w-3cqh-f6jx
SUMMARY Weak Password Recovery Mechanism for Forgotten Password
DETAILS In “Dolibarr” application, v2.8.1 to v13.0.2 are vulnerable to account takeover via password reset functionality. A low privileged attacker can reset the password of any user in the application using the password reset link the user received through email when requested for a forgotten password.
